    "text": "Gehera\u00f0 nu m\u00e6n \u00f0a leofestan hu us godes bec moniega\u00fe and myndiga\u00f0 to ures lifes cl\u00e6nnesse and\nFor\u00f0an us myndiga\u00f0 godes bec \u00fe\u00e6t we ure \u00e6lmessan sellan earmum mannum and to godes circean and\nH\u00e6bbe \u00e6ghwilc man be his m\u00e6\u00f0e \u00fea god \u00fee god wite \u00fe\u00e6t he gedon m\u00e6ge and seo \u00e6lmesse sceal beon\nAnd simle to halgum tidum we hie geornost sellen, for\u00f0an \u00fee hit awriten is on cristes bocum \u00fe\u00e6t man\nAnd gif hie mid rihte gestrenede beo\u00f0, hu m\u00e6g se cristena man beon so\u00fef\u00e6st and cl\u00e6ne and gode\nHe us mid his \u00ferowunge aliesde of \u00feam heordestan and \u00feam grimmestan hellewitum for \u00fey we nu on\nFor\u00fean manige syndan so\u00f0f\u00e6ste weorc \u00fee man wyrcean sc\u00e6l on \u00feas halgan tid eac \u00feam f\u00e6stenne \u00fe\u00e6t\nNe he selfa ne he o\u00feerne ne bidde \u00fey l\u00e6s hiera begra saul \u00feurh \u00f0\u00e6t forloren weor\u00fee, for\u00fean \u00fee se\nAc us man simle bebeode\u00f0 on godes bebodum \u00fe\u00e6t we geneache ure cyricean seccan and \u00fe\u00e6r gehieren\nAc beo ge nu ge\u00feyldige \u00feah eow man mid wordum trege \u00fe\u00e6t ge \u00fea yfelan word ne forgylden mid\nAnd \u00feeah man gehere o\u00f0erne him on\u00f0weorh sprecan \u00feanne ne ge andswerige he na him mid nane yfele,\nFor\u00fean on \u00fea tid \u00fee his saul of his lichaman gewit\u00e6t and heo by\u00fe synfull \u00feanne bi\u00fe hiere ealles gelic\nAc bebeorgan we us nu \u00feani\u00f0erlican witu and gegearwian we us nu \u00feu heofoncundan leoht and \u00feisne\nAc heofona fyr and heofona w\u00e6ter syndan godes \u00e6nglas gewordene.\nAc utan nu geearnian \u00fe\u00e6t we ne becumen to \u00feam uncu\u00f0an witum ac \u00fe\u00e6t we gefeon mid gode \u00e6fter\nFor\u00fean we \u00feanne nu sculan gode onfon mid us swa he selfa cw\u00e6\u00f0, In me manet et ego in uobis sed\nFor \u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t geara gelamp \u00feurh euan adames wif \u00fe\u00e6t dea\u00fe w\u00e6s gangende on middangeard and \u00fea w\u00e6s\nAnd cu\u00f0lice \u00fea drihten \u00fey \u00feriddan d\u00e6ge of dea\u00fee aras fram helwarum and \u00fea geb\u00e6dan him \u00e6rest wif\nAnd he w\u00e6s \u00e6rest fram \u00feam wimman nu \u00e6tywed for\u00fean us \u00e6rest dea\u00f0 \u00feurh wifman ongefeoll and \u00fea\nAnd \u00fea us wutodlice becom ure drihten \u00feurh marian leoma \u00fe\u00e6re halchan f\u00e6mnan \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t drihten\n\u00deus us onfeng ure drihten \u00feurh hine selfne \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00fe\u00e6t we hine onfengon on us.\n\u00deis word \u00feanne tacna\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t se man onfeh\u00fe godes se \u00f0e rihtlice gehere\u00fe swa swa hine wise gel\u00e6ra\u00f0.\nGod us hafa\u00f0 beboden \u00fe\u00e6t we him \u00feeowigen on cl\u00e6nan lichaman for\u00fean he w\u00e6s geboren \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6re\nLufian we hine for\u00fean simle mid cl\u00e6ne lichaman and mid hluttre ge\u00feance.\n\u00deanne adilga\u00f0 he us crist fram eallum urum synnum and we magon geearnian gif we selfe willa\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00deis word \u00feanne tacna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t crist selfa behealde\u00f0 \u00fea m\u00e6n \u00fea \u00fee tela do\u00f0 and deofol tihta\u00f0 \u00feam \u00fee on\nHu magan \u00fea cwe\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t hie sien cristene ac us gedafna\u00fe anra gehwilcum \u00fe\u00e6t he us ahebbe on \u00fea\nHu m\u00e6g se man beon cristen gif he flite\u00f0 wi\u00f0 cristes bebodu ac \u00fea \u00f0e siendan \u00feurh god gewordene\nFor\u00fean he is swi\u00fee mihtig \u00fe\u00e6t he eow forgyfe eces lifes reste swa he selfa w\u00e6s sprecende and he\nFor\u00fean he bebead \u00e6g\u00fe\u00e6r ge on \u00fe\u00e6re ealden \u00e6 ge on \u00fe\u00e6re niwan \u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6t we heolden ures drihtnes\n\u00dea bebead he us on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t we lufedan us betweonum and \u00fea drihten hine \u00e6tywde oft on eor\u00fean\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he be his gingrum, Ge beo\u00fe mine discipulo gif ge eow lufia\u00f0 eow betweonum.\nAnd for\u00f0an men \u00fea leofestan, weor\u00feia\u00f0 eow selfe betweonan eow for\u00f0an we syndan ealra anra leoman\nAnd he is so\u00felice \u00f0\u00e6t ge\u00few\u00e6re leohtes bearn and \u00fea beo\u00f0 witodlice \u00feeostra bearn \u00fea \u00f0e willa\u00f0 simle\nFor\u00f0an se man se \u00f0e de\u00f0 manige synna se bi\u00f0 \u00feiestra bearn and deofla bearn geciged and \u00fea m\u00e6n \u00fea\n\u00dea beo\u00f0 godes bearn geciged and \u00f0a m\u00e6n \u00fea \u00f0e do\u00f0 god and drihtnes willan, \u00feanne wunia\u00f0 \u00feara saula\nAnd seo \u00e6lmesse bi\u00fe hiera synna forgifenes and hiere organan beo\u00f0 \u00fea halgan godes word \u00fee men\nAnd ne sece\u00fe drihten nan \u00feinc mare fram \u00feam mannum butan \u00fe\u00e6t hie his naman on \u00e6lce wisan\nAnd we sculan swi\u00f0e geornlice mid urum saulum and mid urum lichaman ahebban \u00fe\u00e6s heofonlican\n\u00deanne beo\u00fe ure saule halie gewordene and hiere becyme\u00f0 swi\u00fee gefealic blis fram \u00feam ecean cyninge\nBeo\u00f0 \u00e6lce d\u00e6ge fedde fram \u00feam heofonlican cyninge \u00fe\u00e6s mannes saul bi\u00f0 liflic and cyme\u00f0 fram\nSe lichama for\u00f0an he sceal beon mid eor\u00f0an fed and \u00fe\u00e6s mannes saul bi\u00f0 godes oro\u00f0es and heo for\u00f0an\nHw\u00e6t \u00feanne we beo\u00f0 mid \u00f0urste and mid hungre gewyrde ac we willa\u00f0 \u00feanne sone drincan and etan\nAc gegearwien we ura saula cl\u00e6nnesse mid lufan and mid ea\u00f0modnesse and mid arf\u00e6stnesse and mid\n\u00deonne us man on\u00f0weorh to sprece and mid w\u00e6ccean and mid mildheortnesse and mid sigef\u00e6stnesse\n\u00deis \u00f0onne is swi\u00f0e gastlic weorc and swi\u00f0e halwendlic, and mid \u00feyllicum m\u00e6genum bi\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6s mannes\nAnd \u00fea m\u00e6n \u00fee \u00f0is eall beo\u00fe donde, \u00feanne beo\u00f0 \u00feara saula breohtran \u00feanne sunne \u00feanne heo\nAnd hit is cweden on \u00f0issum godspelle \u00fe\u00e6t deofla l\u00e6dan \u00f0a saule.\nAnd \u00feanne heo sprece\u00f0 wependre st\u00e6fne to \u00f0am deoflum, and hyo cwe\u00fe, Micle siendon \u00fea \u00f0yostre \u00fee\nAnd \u00feanne andsweria\u00f0 hire \u00f0a deoflo, and hie cwe\u00f0a\u00f0, Maran \u00fee siendan toweard in helle.\n\u00deanne cwe\u00f0 seo saul eft, Micel is \u00f0eos unrotnes \u00fee ge me to l\u00e6da\u00f0.\nAnd \u00feanne andsweria\u00f0 hiere \u00fea deofle, and hie cwe\u00f0a\u00f0, Maran gewin and mare unblis \u00fee is\nAnd \u00feanne \u00e6fter \u00feysum wordum hie l\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00fea saule on hellewitu.\nOnd \u00feanne bi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s halgan mannes saul, wutodlice \u00feanne heo of \u00f0am lichaman gange\u00f0, seofon si\u00f0um\nAnd \u00fea halgan Godes \u00e6nglas hie l\u00e6da\u00f0 to Paradysum.\nAnd \u00feanne cwy\u00f0 seo saul to \u00f0am \u00e6nglum \u00fee hie l\u00e6da\u00f0, Eala, mycel is \u00f0eos blis \u00fee ic on gel\u00e6dad eam.\nOnd \u00feanne andswergea\u00f0 hire \u00fea \u00e6nglas and cwe\u00f0a\u00f0, Mare blis \u00fee is on heofonum gegearwad.\nOnd \u00feanne seo saul eft cwe\u00f0, Micel is \u00fees \u00ferym \u00fee we on syndan.\nAnd \u00feanne andswergea\u00f0 hiere \u00fea \u00e6nglas and cwe\u00f0a\u00f0, \u00feu cymest ful \u00e6r to maran \u00ferymme.\nOnd \u00feanne cwy\u00f0 seo saul \u00feriddan si\u00f0e, Mycel is \u00feis leoht \u00fee ic on eam.\nOnd \u00feanne andswergea\u00f0 hiere \u00fea \u00e6nglas and hie cwe\u00f0a\u00f0, \u00feu gemetst mare leoht mid Gode.\nOnd \u00feanne synga\u00f0 \u00fea halgan \u00e6nglas swi\u00f0e gastlingne sang, and bera\u00f0 \u00f0a cl\u00e6nan sawle to Gode on\nAnd hie cw\u00e6\u00f0a\u00f0 to \u00f0\u00e6re sawle, Beatus quem elegisti, replebimur; Hie cwe\u00f0a\u00f0, Eadig eart \u00f0u, sawl, \u00f0u\n\u00d0in templ his halig and wenn and wundorlicre \u00f0rymnesse.\nOnd hie cwe\u00f0a\u00f0 eft be \u00f0are sawle, Eadig eart \u00f0u, sawl, \u00f0u geheold \u00f0ines Drihtnes bebodu, and \u00f0u\nEala, \u00f0u halige \u00f0rynnes, F\u00e6der and Sunu and Halig Gast, \u00f0u \u00f0e \u00e6fre w\u00e6re, and \u00e6fre bist, and nu eart,\nOn \u00f0e we gelefa\u00f0 and hihte\u00f0, \u00f0\u00e6t us ne \u00f0urfe sceamian, and \u00f0\u00e6t us ure fynd ne gebismrian.\nEala, \u00f0u God \u00e6lmihtig, and eala, \u00f0u ece Dryhten, and eala, \u00f0u undeadlice Scyppend, \u00f0e we bida\u00f0 and\nAnd we geearnian \u00f0\u00e6t we motan becuman to \u00f0inum rice and mid \u00f0e rixian on heofona rices wuldre\nAnd nu men \u00f0a leofestan, ondr\u00e6dan we us \u00f0ara awieredra deofla sweartnesse and hellebrogan hiora\n\u00de\u00e6r bi\u00fe eagona wop and to\u00fea gristbitung and welera \u00feurst and \u00fe\u00e6r beo\u00fe saula on miclum geflitum\n\u00de\u00e6r bi\u00fe singallic cyrm and gelomlic geomrung, \u00fe\u00e6r beo\u00fe \u00f0a synfullan saula forgitene.\nHeora eardungstow bi\u00fe mid deoflum \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00fe wite butan \u00e6nde and \u00f0eostra butan leohte, and cleopung\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00fe \u00f0\u00e6t ece sar and orwene \u00fe\u00e6t him \u00e6fre \u00f0\u00e6s sar linne and him her n\u00e6fre ne becyme\u00fe n\u00e6nig\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t beo\u00f0 \u00f0a arleasan \u00f0e simle hiera dea\u00f0es wyrcea\u00f0 and him ne geseald ne bi\u00f0 na \u00f0y hra\u00f0or.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00fe fyren mere swilce o\u00f0ru s\u00e6 and \u00fe\u00e6t is swi\u00fee orm\u00e6te deopnes \u00f0\u00e6s grundes and eal yfel\n\u00deis \u00f0onne is synfulra stow onto eardianne.\nAnd hiera gebunes \u00f0\u00e6r \u00f0onne beo\u00fe on \u00feisum \u00f0a forlegeran and \u00fea godwracan and \u00fea welgan \u00fee mid\n\u00d0onne onfeh\u00fe he \u00feyllicum tintregum swilce on \u00f0isum bocum s\u00e6ge\u00f0.\n\u00deonne \u00e6fter \u00f0on \u00fea halgan and \u00fea so\u00f0f\u00e6stan mid criste mid hyra godum wyrcum \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feonne syndan \u00f0a\nHie h\u00e6fdon mycle forh\u00e6fdnesse and forwyrnednesse hiera lichaman lustes and hie nu eardia\u00f0 mid\n\u00d0\u00e6r bi\u00f0 leohtes leoht and willa \u00f0\u00e6s leohtes and \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 ece gefea and \u00feer bi\u00f0 \u00e6ngla breohtnes and\nAc \u00f0\u00e6r bi\u00f0 blis butan \u00e6nde and iugo\u00f0 butan yldo and \u00fe\u00e6r n\u00e6fre niht ne ge\u00f0eostra\u00f0 ac \u00f0\u00e6r simle\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6r ne beo\u00f0 n\u00e6nige tintrega geywed ac \u00f0\u00e6r bi\u00f0 seo ece h\u00e6lend and syo ece lufu swi\u00fee\nAnd \u00feonne ne bi\u00f0 us mid gode \u00f0on mare gewin gesewen ne gegearwod \u00feonne \u00feysum halgum w\u00e6s \u00f0e\nGif we willa\u00f0 ure synna geswican and gode ea\u00f0mode beon swa drihten selfa w\u00e6s sprecende and\nAnd \u00feonne wepa\u00f0 swi\u00f0e biterlice ealle \u00f0a \u00f0e nu do\u00f0 unrihtwisnesse and \u00feonne magon elle eor\u00f0lice\nAnd \u00feonne beo\u00f0 ealle gesc\u00e6fta swi\u00f0e onhrerede beforan him and heofon bi\u00f0 gefealdan on \u00f0a tid swa\nAnd \u00feonne ealle eor\u00f0an m\u00e6g\u00f0a geseo\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t micle sigebeacen \u00fe\u00e6t is seo halige cristes rod and \u00feonne\n\u00deonne magon \u00f0a werigan gastas geseon hwone hie \u00e6r oferhogodan and his bebodu healdan noldan.\nAnd \u00feonne s\u00e6nda\u00f0 drihten his \u00e6nglas on feower \u00e6ndas \u00f0ises middangeardes and \u00feonne beo\u00f0\nAnd \u00feonne fram heofones heanessum o\u00f0 eor\u00f0an gem\u00e6ru beo\u00f0 gesamnode gode on \u00f0a swi\u00f0ran healfe\n\u00d0\u00e6r bi\u00f0 wop and to\u00f0a grystbitung se w\u00e6s g\u00e6ra gegearwod deoflum and his \u00e6nglum and h\u00e6\u00f0enum\nWala \u00feonne \u00feam synfullum \u00f0e hyra gebunes bi\u00f0 mid deoflum.\nEala \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feonne bi\u00f0 ormetlic sea\u00f0 mid \u00f0am deoflum and n\u00e6fre \u00f0a wyrmas ne swelta\u00f0 \u00f0e on \u00f0am sea\u00f0e\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6r ne bi\u00f0 n\u00e6fre \u00f0ara tintrega fyr adwysced ne \u00f0\u00e6r n\u00e6fre n\u00e6nig stefn bi\u00f0 gehered butan\nWala \u00feam mannum \u00f0e \u00f0\u00e6r sculan beon onbelocene on \u00f0am synfullan sea\u00f0e and hie beo\u00f0 bed\u00e6lde\nAnd hie beo\u00f0 gode ofergytene and hie ne becuma\u00f0 n\u00e6fre on his gemynde and hyra mete bi\u00f0 tintrego\nSeo stow \u00feonne bi\u00f0 gegearwod \u00f0am yflum and \u00feam arleasum and hit is gegearwod \u00f0am mannum \u00f0e\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00f0onne to gerecenesse seo heofonlice gebunes and \u00fe\u00e6r \u00f0onne scina\u00f0 \u00f0a so\u00f0f\u00e6stan on hyra\nAc \u00f0\u00e6r drihten bi\u00f0 sittende on \u00f0am ecean leohte and \u00fe\u00e6r bi\u00f0 singallice swi\u00f0e orm\u00e6tu brihtnes and\nAnd hie \u00feonne onginna\u00f0 singan drihtne niwne sang swi\u00f0e unwi\u00f0erweardlicum stefnum and \u00fe\u00e6r \u00f0onne\nWunia\u00f0 \u00f0onne mid criste \u00f0am \u00f0e nu lyfa\u00f0 and ricsa\u00f0 mid god f\u00e6der \u00f0am sie wuldor and lof a in ealra",
